 "notes": [
  "Plain handwritten list (no PC form, no username/event/date), quantities \"x2\"/\"x3\", \"V\" after a card = virtual. Expanded one line per copy in list order; 60 cards + 12 shields (3rd column). An arrow links \"Knowledge & Defense\" to the shield column.",
  "Last line of column 1 is cut off at the scan edge: \"A Bright Cente[r...] V\" -> A Bright Center To The Universe (V).",
  "UNSURE: \"CC: DB\" -> Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) (only DS Cloud City docking bay in GEMP). \"◇ Storm Clouds\" -> Storm Clouds (symbol before it unclear). \"Kir K w/ Pike\" -> Kir Kanos With Force Pike (wiki title). \"Ony x 2\" read as Onyx 2 (a single card; reading as Onyx x2 would make 61).",
  "Struck through in shields: \"Let Fate-a Decide\" (not counted)."
